# Trust-anchor material. Changing any of these changes who the ecosystem trusts,
# so it must be a reviewed decision rather than a side effect of a script.
#
# This file is half of the SOC-7 control. scripts/verify-pins.mjs makes a
# certificate swap VISIBLE (it can no longer be auto-derived into manifest.json);
# CODEOWNERS plus branch protection is what makes that visibility mean something.
# Without required review on `main`, an author edits the cert and its pin in one
# commit and nothing has changed. They are one control, not two.

/countries/           @chongkan
/anchors/             @chongkan
/trust-pins.json      @chongkan
/scripts/verify-pins.mjs   @chongkan
/scripts/generate-pins.mjs @chongkan
/.github/workflows/   @chongkan
